                                "example_id": "339859d5-67d1-4768-8711-8b7cc4454ca3",
                                "sense_id": "6277bcfc-5007-3841-95cc-5530aca4ef5c",
                                "text": "From looking round, I realized that the gap in the market was for smart one-bedders in central locations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "728488fd-3194-4284-8ba2-7fcfc433b78f",
                                "sense_id": "6277bcfc-5007-3841-95cc-5530aca4ef5c",
                                "text": "The main gripe with new condominiums these days is the lack of space, and that was apparent in this three-bedder unit with its small bedrooms and communal spaces."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ced9caea-0133-434c-b2d0-ae0bd335457a",
                                "sense_id": "6277bcfc-5007-3841-95cc-5530aca4ef5c",
                                "text": "Well if it’s a two-bedder, it’s not too big a problem. Such units are still big enough for her and her partner, and maybe their first child too."
                            }
                        ]
